  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0078_8a34c5561b9b.png\" style=\"height: 68px; width: 280px;\" /><br /><br />Let the temperature of the junction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> .</p><p>Rate of heat flow in Rod <math><mn>1</mn></math> = rate of heat flow in Rod <math><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>kA</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>kA</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn>